{"4066010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doomed Night: Build Base & Explore", "steam_appid": 4066010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As commander and protector, it falls to you to rebuild what was lost, expand your dominion, and lead your people through the rising darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, explore the land and lay the foundations of your kingdom. Train soldiers and fortify your walls to prepare for the night. Every decision from resource management to battle readiness determines whether your people will thrive or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the portals awaken. <strong>Fight alongside</strong> your army and face relentless waves of monsters in real-time tower defense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/c4814521a75b207a03598e03c02dddef.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/1f47593ed3de88f0b2817e95e5f8f677.poster.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/1f47593ed3de88f0b2817e95e5f8f677.webm?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/1f47593ed3de88f0b2817e95e5f8f677.mp4?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your settlement from a humble camp to a fortified stronghold ready to withstand the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/17c5a91c8b3df11ed07748facb10d5d4.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/d51d4580d4c31fc33cef904017f03cf0.poster.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/d51d4580d4c31fc33cef904017f03cf0.webm?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/d51d4580d4c31fc33cef904017f03cf0.mp4?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture across the map, secure resources, and unlock new opportunities for your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/0ea643e7f045d61e825c69983cdfbf77.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/e091e61b486a17d38adea16940b858b0.poster.avif?t=1786950012\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/e091e61b486a17d38adea16940b858b0.webm?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066010/extras/e091e61b486a17d38adea16940b858b0.mp4?t=1786950012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your forces in intense tower defense battles and hold the line against overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa